{"id":"gojodeath","lines":[{"t":0.2,"end":5.37,"chars":[0],"who":"Gojo","text":"Well... if sukuna regained all his power... he might cause me a bit of trouble","de":"Naja... wenn Sukuna seine volle Kraft zurueckhaette... koennte er mir etwas Aerger machen","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":5.94,"end":8.14,"chars":[1],"who":"Yuji","text":"but would you lose?","de":"Aber wuerdest du verlieren?","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":8.68,"end":10.98,"chars":[0],"who":"Gojo","text":"Nah. I'd Win","de":"Nee. Ich wuerde gewinnen.","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":11.1,"end":13.5,"chars":[0],"who":"Gojo","text":"*Shocked Painful Moans*","de":"*schockierte, schmerzhafte Stoehner*","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":14.26,"end":15.66,"chars":[0],"who":"Gojo","text":"*painful exhale*","de":"*schmerzhaftes Ausatmen*","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":31.38,"end":37,"chars":[2],"who":"Sukuna","text":"Your Infinity ment nothing... as long as it existed in that space...","de":"Dein Infinity bedeutete nichts... solange es in diesem Raum existierte...","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":37.52,"end":39.52,"chars":[2],"who":"Sukuna","text":"That World...","de":"Diese Welt...","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":40.14,"end":44.34,"chars":[2],"who":"Sukuna","text":"You were magnificent... Satoru Gojo","de":"Du warst grossartig... Satoru Gojo","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":45.2,"end":47.68,"chars":[2],"who":"Sukuna","text":"i shall never forget you...","de":"Ich werde dich nie vergessen...","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":48.7,"end":51.3,"chars":[2],"who":"Sukuna","text":"For as long as i live...","de":"Solange ich lebe...","orig":"scenes/gojodeath/lines/10.mp3"}]}